# public Kaggle resumes; the PDFs, drafts and review sheets stay local).
eval/labels/*
!eval/labels/gold.csv
!eval/labels/RULINGS.md
!tests/fixtures/*.pdf
!tests/fixtures/*.docx
!tests/fixtures/demo/*.pdf
